<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-LEADING QUALIFIERS FOR INDY 500.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LEADING QUALIFIERS FOR INDY 500.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Indiana 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top 10 qualifiers</p>
<p>Saturday for the Indy 500 to be held on May 25:</p>
<p>1. Arie Luyendyk (Netherlands) G-Force Oldsmobile</p>
<p>2. Tony Stewart (U.S.) G-Force Oldsmobile</p>
