<p>5. Scott Goodyear (Canada) G-Force Oldsmobile</p>
<p>6. Jim Guthrie (U.S.) Dallara Oldsmobile</p>
<p>7. Jeff Ward (U.S.) G-Force Oldsmobile</p>
<p>8. Davey Hamilton (U.S.) G Force Oldsmobile</p>
<p>9. Eliseo Salazar (Chile) Dallara Oldsmobile</p>
<p>10. Buddy Lazier (U.S.) Dallara Oldsmobile</p>
